{"body":[{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200707/9672_46244_1755.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"p","x":"SEOUL, Korea (AVING) -- <Visual News> PRIMA presented its 52-inch full HD LCD TV ‘LC-52R36’ during SINOCES 2007, which adopted Sharp’s panel. It supports 1920x1080 resolution, 800cd/m2 brightness, 178-degree viewing angle and 4ms response speed."},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200707/9672_46245_1755.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200707/9672_46246_1755.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200707/9672_46247_1755.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200707/9672_46248_1755.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200707/9672_46249_1755.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200707/9672_46250_1755.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200707/9672_46251_1756.jpg","cap":""}]}